B = [
('Facel Vega','Europe','1950s-60s','cars','In the style of Facel Vega, rich, glamorous jet-age French grand luxury. Long, low, horizontal masses built from stacked pairs of vertical forms, very thin slender supports and generous polished chrome edging with a crisp, flat, squared-off finish. Palette of black, silver, bright red, cream and deep blue. Supple leather, polished metal fittings, fine wire-like patterns and white-faced round graphics. Opulent yet athletic, an expensive and slightly dangerous elegance.'),
('Pagani','Europe','2000s-present','cars','In the style of Pagani, jewel-like, rounded, artisan handcrafted Italian design. Organic, flowing, sculpted volumes that show exposed carbon-fibre weave beside fine polished and milled aluminium. Deep blue, silver and black with tan leather and fine visible stitching. Every tiny fitting and fastening is machined and displayed like jewellery, with a workshop obsession for detail. Rich tactile materials, intricate metal lattice patterns and a calm, precious, handmade luxury.'),
('DS','Europe','1950s-60s','cars','In the style of DS, futuristic, serene and floating, like a spaceship landed in a quiet street. Streamlined forms tapering gently to one end, very low smooth surfaces, volumes that seem to hover on thin supports, and pale tops set against darker bodies. Softly curved panels with no sharp creases and gently skirted lower edges. Pale grey, ivory, sea green, pastel blue and sand. Plush cloth and soft leather in sculpted, flowing shapes. Calm, modern and quietly strange.'),
('Ford','North America','1960s','cars','In the style of Ford, honest, approachable, everyday mass-market American design of the 1960s. Long, wide, low proportions with one sharp scalloped crease running along the side and a single slim chrome line. White, poppy red, turquoise, pale yellow and dark green with moderate chrome. Plain painted steel, broad padded bench-like shapes and woodgrain trim keep it ordinary and friendly. Confident without showing off, clean, practical and optimistic.'),
('Chevrolet','North America','1950s','cars','In the style of Chevrolet, cheerful, optimistic diner-era American design of the 1950s. Bright chrome with round bullet shapes, sharply pointed upswept trim, small rocket-like ornaments and sweeping two-tone areas split by one long chrome spear. Wraparound curves, whitewall roundness and generous shine. Two-tone vinyl and chrome-ringed round forms. Turquoise and ivory, coral and white. Sunny, glossy and confident.'),
('Cadillac','North America','1959','cars','In the style of Cadillac, excessive, glamorous, jet-age opulence of vast length and width. Heavy chrome edging, jewelled mesh textures, paired stacked shapes, one long flat mass, thin floating planes and a laurel-wreath and crest motif. Towering pointed upswept blades with twin bullet shapes exaggerate length and glitter. Pink, pearl white, powder blue and black with chrome everywhere. Tufted leather and deep carpet. Showy, extravagant and unashamedly rich.'),
('Buick','North America','1950s','cars','In the style of Buick, comfortable middle-class luxury of the 1950s, rounded and heavily chromed, dignified rather than flashy. A toothy chrome grin of many small bars, large round chrome bullet shapes, a row of three or four round portholes and a sweeping chrome spear along the side. Slightly bulbous, plump forms and a tri-shield motif. Cream, sea green, coral and maroon. Warm, prosperous and reassuring.'),
('Pontiac','North America','1960s-70s','cars','In the style of Pontiac, aggressive, swaggering street-racer American muscle of the 1960s and 70s. Split twin-nostril shapes divided by a body-coloured beak, stacked or hidden forms, a waistline swelling over tall haunches, one long raised bulge and bold parallel stripes. Brushed metal rally patterns with bright trim rings and a red arrowhead mark. Carousel red, deep green, ivory and bright orange. Black vinyl bucket shapes with engine-turned panels add attitude.'),
('Dodge','North America','1970s','cars','In the style of Dodge, brutal, loud, cartoonish tough-guy American muscle of the early 1970s. Wide aggressive stance, a long flat mass with bulging twin humps, squared-off edges with a pronounced hip, a bold bumblebee band and an abrupt ducktail kick at the end. Slotted metal textures, black vinyl and chunky proportions. High-impact violet, lime green, purple, bright orange and pale green, with red stripes. Swaggering, noisy and showy.'),
('Chrysler','North America','1957-1960s','cars','In the style of Chrysler, late 1950s and early 60s forward-look American design, space-age, optimistic and airy. Long slender profiles, huge expanses of wraparound transparency, wide-mouthed forms with a bright bar and flowing side chrome with a contrasting colour panel. Sculpted panels, luxurious fabric and tall swept-back blades. Turquoise, flamingo pink, cream and charcoal. Push-button crispness and confident, uplifting streamlining.'),
('Lincoln','North America','1960s','cars','In the style of Lincoln, understated, sober, expensive American flagship luxury of the 1960s. Slab-sided, perfectly flat surfaces, a thin knife-edge horizontal line, restrained fine horizontal bars, long level tops and a square formal outline. Minimal chrome in a thin shoulder strip, slim vertical forms and a star mark in a plain rectangle. Flat panels with brushed metal and deep leather create grave dignity. Black, midnight blue, silver and white.'),
('Jeep','North America','1940s-present','cars','In the style of Jeep, rugged, utilitarian, honest, military-derived adventure design. Flat, boxy slabs with upright vertical slots flanked by round forms, squared-off curves, short overhangs and soft canvas or hard tops. Olive drab, sand, desert tan, safety yellow and bright orange. Exposed bolts and hinges, heavy black matte plastic edging, chunky knobby textures and bare painted metal with grab handles. Hose-down simplicity, function first.'),
('Tesla','North America','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Tesla, minimalist, clean, futuristic and software-first electric design. Smooth, unbroken surfaces, a low sloping line, slim LED shapes, a thin horizontal band of light and large glass planes. Aerodynamic turbine-style patterns, flush details, body-coloured trim and almost no chrome. Pearl white, solid black, deep blue metallic, midnight silver and red. Closed-off surfaces and a single huge landscape screen in a stark white or black space remove all buttons.'),
('Studebaker','North America','1950s','cars','In the style of Studebaker, quirky, futuristic and a bit strange American design of the 1950s. Low, wide stance, a slim body, a low profile, an almost European flat-sided silhouette and a gently tapering end. Chrome edges, pointed bullet-nose forms like an aircraft spinner and a streamlined panel with a big round dial and brushed metal. Gold or turquoise tops. Pale pastel two-tone paint in pink and white, sky blue and cream.'),
('Packard','North America','1930s-40s','cars','In the style of Packard, stately, hushed, old-money American luxury of the 1930s and 40s. Tall, narrow, pointed-shield shapes with fine vertical bars, very long masses and sweeping separate curved wing forms. Deep gloss black, maroon, dark green and cream with a thin coach line. Walnut veneer, mohair or leather, elegant engine-turned metal, whitewall roundness and a chrome flying ornament. Poised, quiet and dignified.'),
('Hudson','North America','1948-1954','cars','In the style of Hudson, hunkered, bathtub-shaped and solid American design of the late 1940s and early 1950s. A step-down body with a very low floor, a wide low simple chrome front with a triangle mark, a smooth slab end, a sloping outline, skirted lower edges, a heavy brow and a rounded finish. Two-tone paint in maroon and cream, deep green and tan. Heavy, safe and substantial.'),
('Oldsmobile','North America','1950s-60s','cars','In the style of Oldsmobile, jet-age, confident and glossy American rocket-themed optimism. A bright wide front with a central round jet-like form, long sweeping chrome lines down each flank, wraparound curves and a canopy on thin supports. Chrome with spinning centres and gleaming bright trim throughout. Rocket red, white, mint green and sky blue, laid out as two-tone vinyl and shining surfaces. Streamlined, speedy motifs repeated everywhere. Cheerful and polished.'),
('DeSoto','North America','1950s','cars','In the style of DeSoto, dramatic and theatrical American showmanship of the mid to late 1950s. A tall vertical oval like a pursed mouth, heavy chrome brows, sharply pointed upswept edges with arrow-shaped trim and one long sweeping chrome spear that splits two-tone paint. Hooded, wraparound forms, plush fabric and a bold sculpted panel. Pink and charcoal, turquoise and white, sunset orange. Flamboyant, confident and a little overblown.'),
('Edsel','North America','1958-1960','cars','In the style of Edsel, overwrought, odd and unforgettable American design. A tall vertical horse-collar shape set in the middle of a wide bar, wingtip boomerang forms, side sculpting with a bright spear and a cut-away dip along the flank. Two-tone pink and black, turquoise and white, yellow and brown. Open pillarless transparency, chrome rims with whitewall roundness and a rolling dome of graphics add oddness. Ambitious, fussy and strange.'),
('Tucker','North America','1948','cars','In the style of Tucker, futuristic and streamlined postwar American design. A very low, smooth, rounded teardrop body, a narrow chrome-bar front with a wide mouth and a swept-back profile. Chrome edges and a thin trim line, a padded warm interior and a central cluster of round gauges. Waltz blue, beige, maroon and dark green. Small whitewall roundness and a fully enclosed louvred finish at the back add futurism.'),
('DeLorean','North America','1980s','cars','In the style of DeLorean, matte, metallic, sci-fi, raw and unfinished. A flat angular wedge of bare brushed stainless steel panels with visible grain and no paint, razor-sharp creases and a low long profile. Upward-opening gull-wing planes, flat louvred covers, black plastic edging, slim flat shapes in a plain black strip and dished five-spoke forms in dark grey. Grey leather with a simple flat panel and rectangular pods. Cold, angular and futuristic.'),
('Plymouth','North America','1957-1970','cars','In the style of Plymouth, bold and cheeky American design from the late 1950s through the 1960s. A flat wide bright front with a sailing-ship mark, long sculpted flanks with a sweeping two-tone chrome sweep, a very low top and a full-width chrome bar. Sharp tall fins that blade backward, a tall blade-like spoiler and loud decals with a cartoon bird add cheek. Purple, vivid orange, lemon yellow and bright green.'),
('Mercury','North America','1949-1950s','cars','In the style of Mercury, low, mean and smooth custom-friendly American design of the late 1940s and 1950s. A smooth rounded slab body, a low chopped profile, fat round shapes, teardrop lines flowing into the sides, a sloping line, small forms in a rounded end and a chrome strip along the flank. Skirted lower edges. Candy maroon, primer grey, gloss black and cream.'),
('American Motors','North America','1970s','cars','In the style of American Motors, quirky, offbeat 1970s American pragmatism. Stubby, lopsided proportions with one long mass, one short mass and an abruptly chopped, flat cut-off end. Square shoulders, bulging haunches and plain black plastic trim. Sticker-style lettering, bold red, white and blue stripe sets, plaid in orange and brown, woodgrain panels and oversized round forms picked out in matching colour. Loud colours of bright orange, vivid green, mustard and avocado. Practical, rebellious and cheerfully strange.'),
('Rivian','North America','2020s','cars','In the style of Rivian, rugged, friendly modern adventure design. Tall rounded-rectangle volumes with smooth, closed, featureless surfaces, stadium-shaped vertical details joined by one thin line of light, short overhangs and a high, planted stance. Heavy black matte cladding wraps lower edges and surrounds openings, with chunky forms and turbine-like round motifs. Matte finishes in forest green, lake blue, limestone and glacier white. Warm natural wood, recycled felt and simple clean shapes. Outdoorsy, capable and approachable.'),
('Toyota','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Toyota, sensible, dependable mass-market design given a sharp modern edge. Angular, crisp-edged forms with a large glossy black hourglass shape set low, thin swept details with a hooked inner line, and sculpted upper surfaces. Clean slab sides with one crisp shoulder crease and a smooth coupe-like top line. Large black plastic trim around openings gives a tougher feel. Tidy grey fabric, soft-touch plastics and piano-black panels. Super white, deep black, cool silver, red and bright blue. Reliable and sharp.'),
('Honda','East Asia','1990s-2000s','cars','In the style of Honda, precise, light and clever 1990s and 2000s Japanese engineering. Low, sleek, compact forms with thin swept-back wedge details, generous transparency and tidy rounded shapes ending in a cut-off squared edge. Wide thin openings carry one small letter mark. Sporty accents add red marks, raised blade shapes and bright five-spoke metal motifs. Clear white-on-black graphics, snug proportions and short, neat details. Championship white, bright red, sunny yellow, black and silver. Eager and neat.'),
('Nissan','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Nissan, energetic modern Japanese design built on a bold V-shaped motif in chrome or gloss black and boomerang-shaped paired details. Blacked-out supports create a floating effect. Sharp but flowing lines kick up toward one end, with muscular flared haunches and ribbed upper surfaces. A circular ring mark and sporty multispoke motifs. Quilted stitching and flat-bottomed round shapes. Pearl white, gunmetal, deep blue and bright orange. Dynamic, muscular and sharp.'),
('Datsun','East Asia','1970s','cars','In the style of Datsun, cheerful, honest 1970s Japanese small-scale design. Long, low, rounded forms with thin chrome edging, round shapes in bright bezels and a short, tidy fastback profile. Thin supports, black rubber inserts, side stripes and a small bright mark. Plain slab-sided utility forms with chrome bars. Simple black vinyl, round white-on-black graphics and thin lines. Orange, lime yellow, sky blue and white. Compact, friendly and unpretentious.'),
('Mazda','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Mazda, elegant, sensual, clean design that uses soft flowing reflections rather than hard creases. Long proportions, a low volume set far back, a fine chrome wing shape across a large five-point opening and narrow dark details with a sharp inner glare. Short smooth overhangs, a slim chrome line along the glass edge, rounded details with a single ring and dark metal with machined faces. Thin horizontal lines, matte metal and red or white leather. Deep crystal red, machine grey and soft pearl. Calm and restrained.'),
('Subaru','East Asia','1990s-2000s','cars','In the style of Subaru, purposeful, rugged, slightly aggressive rally-bred design. Practical boxy volumes with short overhangs, flared curves, a raised bulge on the upper surface, tall blade shapes, swept details, frameless transparency and big round accent forms. A cluster of six stars acts as the mark. Gold-painted multispoke details. Plain dark fabric with bright blue or red stitching. Deep rally blue with gold accents, white, black and silver. Functional, tough and a little cheeky.'),
('Mitsubishi','East Asia','1990s-2000s','cars','In the style of Mitsubishi, tough, boxy, motorsport-ready design. Aggressive pointed massing, a wide lower mouth shape, narrow slanted details, big round accent forms and a mark of three red diamonds. A large vent on the upper surface, big blade shapes, pumped curves and a short tail. Multispoke white or gunmetal metal motifs. Rugged variants add chunky plastic cladding. Grey plastic surfaces. White, red, silver and black with sporty decals. Hard-edged, purposeful and fast.'),
('Lexus','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Lexus, precise, exaggerated, sharp-featured Japanese luxury. A huge hourglass spindle shape filled with fine mesh, sharp angular details with L-shaped light signatures and deeply creased flanks. A sharp line across the upper surface and a low sleek coupe-like top. One bright oval mark, full-width connected light bars and large multispoke forms with machined edges. Hand-stitched leather, origami-like pleated trim and sweeping lines. Sonic white, obsidian black, red mica and deep blue. Dramatic, polished and meticulous.'),
('Suzuki','East Asia','1980s-2000s','cars','In the style of Suzuki, cute, tiny, sturdy small-scale design. Tall boxy shapes with big square windows, short fronts, and round or rectangular details in simple plastic with a single stylised S mark. Tiny steel forms with plastic covers. Rugged variants are flat slab-bodied with a canvas or hard top and vertical slots. Plain fabric and straight lines. Bright red, pastel blue, yellow and white. Compact, cheerful and unfussy.'),
('Daihatsu','East Asia','1990s-2010s','cars','In the style of Daihatsu, cheerful, toylike miniature design. Boxy rounded volumes with a tall top, a short front, round friendly details and a small smiling shape above a stylised D mark. Black plastic edging, plastic trim around openings, plain discs and big sliding panels. Two-tone pastel paint with a white top. Large clear graphics. Mint green, baby pink, sky blue, cream and sunny yellow. Compact, sweet and playful.'),
('Hyundai','East Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of Hyundai, futuristic, digital, geometric design with a sharp parametric look. A wide cascading surface with details hidden inside it, and pixel-shaped lights in small square blocks. Taut surfaces folded with sharp creases like paper, flush details and a thin full-width strip of square dots. Pixel-pattern motifs. Soft grey or lime fabrics, flat planes and twin widescreen displays. Sleek silver, bright white, cyber grey and deep teal. Crisp, techy and clean.'),
('Kia','East Asia','2010s-present','cars','In the style of Kia, youthful, confident, sharp design. A tiger-nose motif framed by a slim body-coloured or black surround that flows into swept details. Sculpted low front, crisp sporty shoulder, rising window line, muscular haunches and wide light bars with star-map patterns. A simple stylised oval wordmark, black-top two-tone looks and turbine or aero motifs in dark chrome. Curved panoramic display, soft-touch surfaces and bright accents. Snow white, aurora black, sunset red, steel grey and lime. Energetic and bold.'),
('Genesis','East Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of Genesis, rich, elegant, sleek luxury. A big crest shape filled with diamond mesh, a winged mark and two thin horizontal lines of light for a split twin-line signature. Long proportions, an athletic stance, one flowing parabolic line along the side, a low top and flush surfaces. Thin multispoke or mesh motifs. Quilted soft leather, knurled metal and open-pore wood. Matte grey, deep white, silver, deep green and copper. Poised, refined and understated.'),
('Tata Motors','South Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of Tata Motors, robust, urban and friendly modern Indian design. Clean tall boxy volumes with a prominent upright form carrying a flowing wedge of blue or chrome, and a split arrangement with slim strips above and larger forms below. A bold angular shoulder, black cladding around openings, a strong squared stance and big geometric diamond-cut motifs. A swirling oval mark. Brightly painted tall flat masses and contrast stitching. Urban grey, pure white, flame red and deep black.'),
('Mahindra','South Asia','2000s-present','cars','In the style of Mahindra, tough, honest off-road design. Tall upright slab-sided volumes with a vertical seven-slot or multi-bar pattern, a bold chrome ring, large round or squared details, a flat upper surface, black plastic edging and a stubby short tail. Big square arches, chunky forms and a raised intake shape. Simple fabric. Newer forms add a sharp twin-peak mark and twin-line LED details. Deep black, white, bold red and dune beige. Rugged, stiff-stanced and blunt.'),
]
